# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
#
# Keep the build context small, and -- much more importantly -- keep secrets and local
# state out of the image entirely. A `COPY . .` that sweeps up a .env or a populated
# data/ bakes credentials and someone's watch history into a layer that gets pushed to
# a registry.

# Secrets and local state. Never, under any circumstances.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.key

# Build artefacts. The image builds the frontend itself; copying a local node_modules
# in would both bloat the context and risk shipping host-native binaries.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Repository furniture the runtime has no use for.
.git/
.github/
.gitea/
docs/
tests/
*.md
!README.md
